pan, China, and internationally. Stellantis N.V. was founded in 1899 and is based in Hoofddorp, the Netherlands.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Antonio  Filosa | CEO & Executive Director | Age 52 | Compensation: $4.4M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 258K people. Revenue per employee of $654K ranks in the above the sector median among Consumer Cyclical peers. CEO compensation is 7\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (6/10).","financial_summary":["Stellantis N.V. is a large-cap consumer cyclical business with a $11.1B market cap on $169.3B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -3% over the past three years, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at 37% against a 7% cost of capital \u2014 a 30-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The company is burning through $13.9B of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, thin -17.5\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Management returns a meaningful 19.0% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 25% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 1/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.4) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Operating margins 25% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 45% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.44911525138095687},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.2% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 68/100): leveraged balance sheet under pressure; roic below cost of capital \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Consumer Cyclical peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Consumer Cyclical peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Consumer Cyclical sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Bob Broderdorf Returns, Tim Kuniskis Gets Promoted in Another Round of CEO Shake-Ups at Stellantis","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/bob-broderdorf-returns-tim-kuniskis-191927000.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794602182.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.382,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["leadership"]},{"title":"Stellantis Rebukes Woke 3, Gives Tim Kuniskis Another Big Promotion","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/stellantis-rebukes-woke-3-gives-160248000.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794599357.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Stellantis Reappoints Broderdorf, Promotes Kuniskis In CEO Shuffle","source":